  }}}},
  "coverage": {{"score": 1, "evidence": "..."}},
  "usefulness": {{"score": 1, "evidence": "..."}},
  "page_cleanliness": {{"score": 1, "evidence": "..."}}
}}

Rubric:
{rubric}

Source identity: {pair['source_key']}
Raw document ({pair['raw_filename']}):
---
{pair['raw']}
---
Summary ({pair['summary_filename']}):
---
{pair['summary']}
---
"""


